  "_comment": "Staleness rules per data module (owner's rule, 2026-10-03): a filing-driven module is stale when today is past the next expected filing date plus `grace_days`; a daily module when its last refresh is older than `max_age_days`. The next expected filing date is calendar.json → nextResults (confirmed) or the end of its derived window (assumed), both labelled. Evaluated in scripts/oracle/validate-data.mjs (quality_report.modules) and again in the browser (app.js moduleStatus), so a halted pipeline never shows old data as current. `text_derived` modules carry a 'needs review' flag until a figure is confirmed by XBRL or a second reading (validate-data writes the per-figure verdicts).",
